Common StudentAssessmentIndicator 
    documentation "This entity represents an indicator or metric for non-score attributes being sent current Assessment, for example for at-risk name."
    shared string Indicator 
        documentation "The value of the indicator or metric."
        is part of identity
    shared string IndicatorName 
        documentation "The name of the indicator or metric."
        is part of identity
    shared string IndicatorName named IndicatorGroup
        documentation "The name for a group of indicators."
        is optional